                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The interaction of the Earth's atmosphere, hydrosphere, cryosphere, lithosphere, and biosphere, responsible for the climate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ceffbda-4822-4af4-b9d7-968c8b158042",
                                                "sense_id": "8044109d-2e57-39f5-a3be-96c251bbf325",
                                                "text": "The climate system is a part and the atmosphere another part of this. The earth's climate system provides a habitable zone. I agree with scientists who argue that human beings as a part of nature have altered the “natural system” to such an extent that we are now unable to reverse the present system back to a preindustrial or even prehuman state."
                                            }
